      "id": 1350262,
      "name": "[Velina] Graceful Serenade",
      "desc": "When Velina triggers <color=#A6C5FD>Windswept</color>, she recovers <color=#2BAD00>10 Energy and 200 Decibels</color> and consumes all <color=#FFFFFF>Windbite</color> to <color=#2BAD00>enhance the DMG</color> of this <color=#A6C5FD>Windswept</color> by <color=#2BAD00>20%</color> for each point of <color=#FFFFFF>Windbite</color> consumed. Upon using her <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack</color>, Velina gains 1 point of <color=#FFFFFF>Windbite</color>. If this <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack</color> triggers <color=#FFFFFF>Vital View</color>， recovers 1 additional point of <color=#FFFFFF>Windbite</color> ",
